🛠 Tech Stack
Frontend: Semantic HTML5, Modern CSS3 (CSS Variables, Flexbox/Grid).

Typography: Syne (Headings) and Inter (Body) via Google Fonts.

Interactions: Vanilla JavaScript (IntersectionObserver API for scroll animations and count-up logic).

Architecture: Single-page application (SPA) style with optimized performance and mobile-first responsiveness.

